[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":2,"image":"i743"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i11"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"随后今天的广播体操也照常进行。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“第六节！半规管锻炼！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“转圈圈～，转圈圈～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"孩子们","text":"“转圈圈～”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15538"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“转圈圈～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“转圈～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“转圈……呃……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“呕……好晕……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“根本不行嘛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"领操大哥的半规管太弱了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15343"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“转圈转圈～……呜～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这位也一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一边做操――……不，其实从昨晚开始就一直在想了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"怎么把羽未想做的事传达给白羽呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"由我来问。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这确实要相对简单。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，这一次我想让羽未主动行动。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也是为了实现她的那一句“不想逃避”。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“今天的…呃……体操……到此结束……呕……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"体操结束后，大家都在负责盖章的人面前排好了队。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未也乖巧地站在我身旁。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"忽然，听见了孩子们的对话声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“我作业都做完了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“好厉害，那接下来就是疯玩咯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的女孩B","text":"“全部？绘图日记呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“也做好了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“好强啊啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的女孩B","text":"“帅呆啦啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"喂，那是作弊吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……嗯？日记……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔，日记啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"心生一计。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真是美味的海苔呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15412"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“真好吃。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今天早上的“登录奖励”是海苔。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"卷起米饭就能吃，想失败也难。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一顿无与伦比的早餐。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"吃完后，羽未连我的餐具也收拾好了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我自己的我自己收拾就行了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15378"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15436"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“习惯…了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"习惯……习惯？在家里是羽未负责收拾餐具的吗？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15442"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“洗自己的餐具时就顺手……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样啊，那谢谢了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15369"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那我出门一下咯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15350"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“唉……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15337"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“要去哪里……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未露出了不安的神情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“很快就回来，你在家等我。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15366"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……乖乖看家？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对，你一个人没问题吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15582"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……没问题。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15579"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“已经，习惯了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦…”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"心中莫名一紧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我会尽快回来的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15366"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……路上小心。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i31"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"骑着幼兽驶往小卖铺。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然小卖铺的路程步行也只要十分钟，但也是为了尽可能减少羽未“看家”的时间。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……咦，没人吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"店里一个人都没有。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"琳琅满目的点心静静地陈放在这里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“店家出门了吗？我还赶时间呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"向内屋望去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"里面有一扇磨砂玻璃的推拉门。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"透过玻璃隐约看见一个人影在动。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，不是有人嘛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不好意思。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我推开了门。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1046"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……唉？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1045"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唉……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"里面有一名穿着内衣的女子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1047"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":" “呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！” "},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“为什么你先叫起来了啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为我没想到会有个痴女在这里啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“说谁是痴女呢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我……读的是男校，所以对女生没有免疫力的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那你还不快把门关上！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦，好。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1404"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪嗒。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"关上了门。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1405"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，演变成了和一个内衣装扮女子在密室独处的局面。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1404"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“为什么先进来才关门啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你是故意的吧！其实就是盯上我了吧！就是馋我的身子！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不不……我绝无此意……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你倒是馋一下啊！懂不懂礼数啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那啥，你能不能先把衣服穿上？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":" “你先给我出去啊啊啊啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哐当!!"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“人，原来真会飞啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“真希望你有多远飞多远，别再回来了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是，我是有事才来的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过，为什么你会在这里？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这里是你家吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10213"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不是啦，我在这里做兼职的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我刚刚才到店。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那为什么要换衣服？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10210"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“当然是因为流汗了啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10203"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那你一大早就来小卖铺是要买什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10226"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你可别以为这里像大城市一样什么都有卖哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我觉得问题不大……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“噢，找到了，就是这个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"稍微寻了一下就找到了想要的东西。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"Gyaponica牌的绘画日记本。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10269"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这是小孩子用的哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“要的就是这个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10200"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“噢，莫非是给羽未买的？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“多少钱？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“含税价189日元。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10394"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不过，连同这套12色的彩色铅笔一起买的话，只要1000日元就可以了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“买！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10389"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“多谢惠顾。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那我回去了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10203"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唉？这就走了吗？不吃一份刨冰吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未还在家等着呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“得快点回去了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“拜拜。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10227"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我跳上摩托，朝加藤家飞奔而去。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10215"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“哎，真是来也匆匆去也匆匆。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10196"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“很努力地在做爸爸嘛。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我回来啦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13379"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15487"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"急急忙忙赶回家一看，羽未和白羽正在客厅。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两人正坐在坐垫上，面朝着对方。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15340"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13301"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看见我后，两人都露出了安心的神情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你来了啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“毕竟答应你了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13244"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“结果你却不在。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"神色幽怨地瞪着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"猜得到，她和羽未度过了一段尴尬的时间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对不起，我真没想到你会来得这么早。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13274"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那你呢，一大早跑去哪里了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我去买这个了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将买来的东西放在两人面前。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13274"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13259"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“绘图日记？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，来开始你的快乐暑假吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15468"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“唉……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这是魔法绘图日记本。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“魔法？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你试着用这个画出你想做的事吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15573"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“想做的事……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是记录发生过的事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“而是记录你接下来想做的事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“把明天想做的事画下来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“然后就会得到实现。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15378"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……好厉害……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好像轻易就相信了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"见她率真的反应，连我也跟着高兴起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“给你，彩色铅笔。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15547"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未赶紧握起彩色铅笔，展开日记本开始画了起来。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13334"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽露出佩服的神情看着我。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13314"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“真…真的有这样的日记本吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我会错意了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"原来她不是佩服，是真的相信了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了不让羽未察觉，我向白羽招了招手。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13315"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"（像这样，就能知道羽未想做什么了吧？）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"（然后我们再实现她的心愿。）"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13388"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"（………）"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13409"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"（我…我知道的啦……！）"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13385"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"（那种魔法日记本，怎么可能存在嘛……！）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"满脸通红。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13371"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15471"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就在我们交谈期间，羽未也在聚精会神地画着绘画日记。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"到底画了些什么呢。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15538"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……好了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"似乎是画出来了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13274"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“让我看看。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和白羽一起，探头看了看绘画日记。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1406"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"8月1日，也就是今天。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“爸爸……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13234"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不就是你吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"呃，可我不是她爸爸啊……"},{"op":"clear","layer":512},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15538"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“期待期待。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未露出期待的目光看着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这莫非是噩梦的开端……？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看向白羽试图寻求帮助。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13337"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“期待期待。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"连她也是一副期待的眼神。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"见我有些犹豫……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15576"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“这不是魔法绘画日记本……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"风神翼龙是啥玩意来着！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我觉得是蛇和鸟结合后的一种神，不过那玩意是怎么叫的？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"管他的！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咕咕哒啊啊啊！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"咕咕，咕咕哒!!"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"咕咕咕哒！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15511"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“好厉害，真的是魔法绘画日记本呢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪啪啪啪！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未的掌声在客厅回响。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你满意就好……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"同时我感觉我失去了某样重要的东西。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，从这一刻起，羽未手中的绘图册就变成了魔法绘图册。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13337"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“真厉害。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"连白羽也在啪啪鼓掌。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15472"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……羽未，今天的绘图日记还有空的地方。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15468"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你不想看看妈妈版本的风神翼龙吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15597"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13310"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“!!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为这是魔法绘画日记本。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你所写的东西都会成真哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一脸坏笑地看了看白羽。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13307"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“慢着……等等！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15325"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“好了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13343"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"比预料中还要快。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1407"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么到你了，妈妈。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13446"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“呜……呜呜……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":512},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15325"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“期待期待。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嘿嘿。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13331"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“咕咕哒啊啊啊！咕咕，咕咕哒!!咕咕咕哒！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15593"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“哇！哇！唉嘿嘿！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未心情好极了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那就趁着这个势头，把明天以后的日记也写上。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她两眼放光，握着彩色铅笔打开了日记本。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而白羽则是瘫坐在地上满心绝望的模样。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13310"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“你……之前没说过会这样……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，多谢多谢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13415"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我想……毁约了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那可不行。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我可不想放走愿意为了羽未扮演风神翼龙的人。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13346"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那是你自己的问题。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你也有为羽未着想的吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“而且如果真的厌恶的话，扭头就走也不足为奇对吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13253"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13408"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“骑……骑虎难下……而已。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“谢谢，还好找到的是你。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“你这种说法……有些耍赖……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看她的表情，似乎有些闹别扭了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“总之，有了这绘画日记，我们行动起来也方便一些了吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13238"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯，我也觉得。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两人看着正在画图的羽未。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13259"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不过，真的没问题吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哪方面？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13274"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“羽未连天气情况都写上了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喔……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一看，上面还写着突来的骤雨。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15592"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“好期待呀。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那是最好不过……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13253"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“唉，你打算怎么办？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……祈求上天。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“哦……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13274"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“对了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13296"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“西瓜棒。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好的。我现在就去买。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我拿起摩托的钥匙。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]